  "description": "Umbrella package for the Bodu line-oriented text formats on .NET 8 — delimited text (RFC 4180 CSV/TSV), DotEnv, and INI. References Bodu.Text.Delimited, Bodu.Text.DotEnv, and Bodu.Text.Ini, each a System.Text.Json-shaped library with a ref-struct Utf8 reader/writer pair, a serializer, a mutable node DOM, and a read-only document DOM.",
